# Pairs with AliasOwnershipPreserved. A default decision or a guard fault must deny; treating anything but an
# explicit deny as allow lets an alias land unchecked.
MODULE: AppsAliasWritesOnDefault
TARGET: AliasOwnershipPreserved
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the registry writes the alias unless the guard explicitly denies
PERTURBS: SetAlias

--- FIND
        write == decision = "allow"
--- REPLACE
        write == decision # "deny"
--- END
